      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s2"
      },
      "text": "The code in question is a unique implementation of base64 only previously seen in APT17 and not in any public repository, which makes a strong case about attribution to the same threat actor.",
